    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "On July 26, 1863, Confederate forces clashed with a Union expedition at the Battle of Mount Tabor Church near Potecasi Creek.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.dncr.nc.gov/blog/2023/12/01/potecasi-creek-56",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "During that engagement, Union troops were ambushed at Hill’s Bridge over Potecasi Creek, losing seventeen men and many captured.",
